# Bracket-inline with specialized opcodes — `set x [lindex $argv 0]`.
# Tcl 8.6 specializes both `set` (storeStk) and `lindex $argv 0`
# (loadStk + listIndexImm). No invokeStk events fire; the walker emits
# nothing. Locks the §3.2 SPECIALIZED_OP rows for storeStk + listIndexImm
# under Strategy A flat-pc walk.
set x [lindex $argv 0]
---
